A `/** */` comment directly above a declaration or class member is a leading annotation, so the line range starts there.
- A plain comment between it and the declaration is stepped over; a plain comment alone doesn't start the range.
- The header comment is never part of a declaration's range, even right above it.
== args
input/service.ts
== file input/service.ts
